    {
     "line": "The Veterans Resource Center is open to all student veterans, dependents, active duty, and reservists. Among the services we provide:",
     "position": "vrc",
     "window": [
      "The Veterans Resource Center (VRC) is Delta College’s central hub for student veterans, active-duty service members, and military-connected dependents. It provides dedicated support, guidance, and community — including a welcoming space to study, relax, and connect with fellow military-affiliated students or get involved with the Student Veterans of America (SVA) Club. Support is available both in person at the VRC and online through LiveChat.",
      "Transitioning from military to civilian and college life can be challenging, and social isolation remains one of the most common obstacles for veterans. With more than 200 veterans on campus, the VRC is here to help students find community, navigate resources, and succeed academically with staff who understand their unique experiences and needs.",
      "Services We Provide",
      "The Veterans Resource Center is open to all student veterans, dependents, active duty, and reservists. Among the services we provide:",
      "Help utilizing VA benefits",
      "In-house Veterans Education Counselor and School Certifying Official",
      "VA work study opportunities (pending openings)"
